      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1761475200000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rules\n• Read-only: a key that could write → warning (or refused with STRICT_READ_ONLY=true)\n• The model never sees keys, URLs or raw logs — only one-line summaries\n• No priority, no silent fallback: a failing connector shows as UNAVAILABLE evidence\n• Fake mode (demo agent, tests): data from scenario.py, no credentials",
      "originalText": "Rules\n• Read-only: a key that could write → warning (or refused with STRICT_READ_ONLY=true)\n• The model never sees keys, URLs or raw logs — only one-line summaries\n• No priority, no silent fallback: a failing connector shows as UNAVAILABLE evidence\n• Fake mode (demo agent, tests): data from scenario.py, no credentials",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
